    {
      "name": "statements-workbench",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "Statements workbench",
      "description": "Financial statements workbench: inline editing, forecasts, scenarios, annual roll-up, roll forward, calculated metrics and checks.",
      "docs": "Open on complete host-supplied financial statements with report-style inline editing, selectable periods, configurable native forecast methods, service-supplied roll forward, formula-backed calculated metrics, and checks. Scenarios override driver values and whole forecast specs and run natively, with the capital structure priced from the host market when one is supplied. The Annual view rolls results up natively: flows sum, balances take the year end and ratios are recalculated, with per-line methods editable. The schema editor and JSON import are in Advanced. density prop (compact default) sets SurfaceContext and data-density on the root; data-theme is inherited from the host. Host owns data ingestion and persistence. Requires FinstackQueryProvider.",
